    "reviews": [
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJuTVgXdX_AzQRuRZsiSAYvMc/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2eE1xYzB3RRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "這家店的漢堡和三明治品質真的很好！他們的雞肉漢堡可以打9分（滿分10分），雞肉酥脆可口，涼拌高麗菜也很棒。 「屠夫碎肉漢堡」（Butchers Smash）可以打8分（滿分10分），不過不是那種經典的碎肉漢堡。這兩款漢堡最棒的地方在於麵包，香港很多漢堡店都忽略了麵包，導致麵包很乾，影響口感。這家店的漢堡麵包絕對可以打10分（滿分10分）。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Really good quality burgers and sandwiches! Their chicken burger was a 9/10, great crispy chicken and coleslaw. Butchers Smash was an 8/10, not a classic smash charing. The best thing about both was the bun, so many burger joints in Hong Kong sleep on the bread and it really dries out the experience. 10/10 on the burger bun front.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Lewis Askew",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108828914933439542378/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVOUl5H370xRxrzhyoAIbeNUcSbuurqeDSqouRyK9jOgRMn_dzY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7"
        },
        "publishTime": "2024-12-08T03:57:31.421913Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2eE1xYzB3RRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2eE1xYzB3RRAB!2m1!1s0x3403ffd55d6035b9:0xc7bc1820896c16b9"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJuTVgXdX_AzQRuRZsiSAYvMc/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201WFkzVk1ZVVZPYUVSSVVGVklMVjlpWTBzemNtYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "我點了他們家的招牌漢堡外帶，真的很好吃。我家離這裡很近，所以我們以後可能也會來這裡買牛排和肉末。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Ordered their signature Smash burger for takeout and it was really delicious. I live close by so we’ll probably come here to get steaks and minced meats too.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Karen Leung",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103873448423292994767/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVtBgB7RnZUoMEVtDmlqgHElZJ0sOyO7Ry5VOmTGUyGaWO0L5E=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-02-12T08:19:24.950154104Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201WFkzVk1ZVVZPYUVSSVVGVklMVjlpWTBzemNtYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201WFkzVk1ZVVZPYUVSSVVGVklMVjlpWTBzemNtYxAB!2m1!1s0x3403ffd55d6035b9:0xc7bc1820896c16b9"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJuTVgXdX_AzQRuRZsiSAYvMc/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEcmFxVzBRRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "朋友推薦我去，說那裡的三明治很棒。\n\n確實如此。\n\n肉質鮮嫩多汁，起司也很美味。\n\n你還能找到各種波蘭和義大利產品。\n\n絕對值得一去。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "A friend advise to go as sandwiches were great.\n\nAnd we can say thats true.\nMeet is nice and juicy + tasty cheese.\n\nYou also can find different polish and Italian product.\n\nDefinitely good address",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Damien Druon",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100635932131429521066/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2_7QRrVPGp9yFhN_UTrsdib_Zu3GnfSIkyOmy6aORhy61PcSuPA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
        },
        "publishTime": "2024-03-31T09:04:16.154966Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEcmFxVzBRRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEcmFxVzBRRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403ffd55d6035b9:0xc7bc1820896c16b9"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJuTVgXdX_AzQRuRZsiSAYvMc/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swd1gyWllibFF6TFd4YWNHNVlXVlp1VURWeGFVRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "我最喜歡去這家店給我那嗜肉如命的青少年兒子買牛排。他們家的牛排品質始終如一，物超所值，價格也很合理。強烈推薦！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "One of my favourite places to buy steaks for my meat-devouring teenage son. Their steaks are reliably of high quality and of reasonable prices for the value you get. Highly recommended.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Fei Wu",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114683623385791063667/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLvX_3IOQco4-1iuqBkbHxyaMIznEez-EeAIXHvueY-veJlug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-07-11T07:21:50.460093850Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swd1gyWllibFF6TFd4YWNHNVlXVlp1VURWeGFVRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swd1gyWllibFF6TFd4YWNHNVlXVlp1VURWeGFVRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403ffd55d6035b9:0xc7bc1820896c16b9"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJuTVgXdX_AzQRuRZsiSAYvMc/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREaElpLXdBRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "雞肉牛肉漢堡簡直太棒了——是我在三大洲吃過的最好吃的漢堡！老闆人特別好，我的手機快沒電了，還幫我充了電。店裡音樂很勁爆，氣氛特別好。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Incredible chicken and beef burger - best I’ve had on 3 continents so far! The owners are very friendly and let me charge my phone as it was about to die. They pump the music and there’s a really nice, friendly vibe.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Emma Fookwe",
